00:31:00,240 --> 00:31:06,880
So like when he's doing, you know, 10,000 view posts and then all of a sudden one pops off, were you on the hook for a ton of money?

390
00:31:07,440 --> 00:31:08,240
How did you structure that?

391
00:31:08,560 --> 00:31:08,640
Yeah.

392
00:31:08,880 --> 00:31:12,560
So this is like a key thing, I think, all found.

393
00:31:12,720 --> 00:31:22,960
Founders should keep in mind is with influencer and UGC content, you are banking on a like the real money is made in the viral hits, right?

394
00:31:23,440 --> 00:31:33,440
The, you know, you're based your breakeven point or profitable rate on their average views and it's like, okay, like this is the most likely scenario.

395
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:35,680
Well, breakeven maybe get a little profit.

