00:31:36,800 --> 00:31:43,440
And where you make your real money is when they have like one video go mega viral and like all that is profit.

397
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:51,600
And if you're not doing like flat rates, it makes it hard to capture that asymmetric upside that is a viral hit.

398
00:31:51,920 --> 00:32:02,320
So whenever possible, I would try to do flat rate deals because it allows you to capture the asymmetry that is algorithmic content.

